  "instructions": [
    "Whisk the eggs in a bowl until fully blended.",
    "Add the coconut cream, shredded coconut, orange zest, lemon juice, salt, and pepper to the eggs and mix well.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a 10-inch nonstick skillet over medium heat.",
    "Pour the egg mixture into the skillet and cook for 2 minutes until the edges set.",
    "Sprinkle the grated parmesan and chopped basil over the top.",
    "Cover the skillet and reduce heat to low, cooking for another 6 minutes until the frittata is fully set.",
    "Remove from heat and let it rest for 1 minute before slicing.",
    "Serve warm, optionally garnished with extra basil or a drizzle of olive oil."
